  --&AlertMsg|[&WhichMsg(totitlecase)]
  --I. ;Click to Input [&AlertMsg] Message|q;AMessage;What is the [&WhichMsg] message?
  --%ThisComm|foreach;AllComms
    --!a:[&ThisComm]|![&WhichMsg]_msg:[&AMessage]
  --%|
  --^GMPanel|
--X|

--:ResetVar|
  --&Reset|[&reentryval]
  --+|[&Reset]
